# Files that the local iOS build writes back into node_modules. They are build outputs, not
# inputs, but the fingerprint runtime policy hashes them, so building on this machine changed
# the fingerprint and EAS refused the build in CONFIGURE_EXPO_UPDATES. Builds 6 and 7 both died
# that way. EAS computes its fingerprint before xcodebuild runs, so it never sees these.
#
# react-native-maps' podspec has a script_phase that rewrites this header, setting
# HAVE_GOOGLE_MAPS from whether the Google Maps pods are present (1 as published, 0 here).
**/react-native-maps/ios/AirMaps/RNMapsDefines.h
# Xcode's module cache and built xcframework, written into the package during a local build.
**/expo-modules-jsi/apple/.DerivedData/**
**/expo-modules-jsi/apple/Products/**
